[id: ngirp6fy]
[ar: Soen]
[al: Lotus]
[ti: Lotus]
[length: 05:24]

[00:06.69]Gather around
[00:10.55]All the things that we admire
[00:16.54]To be here is where I wanted to be
[00:22.64]To abandon who I was
[00:27.05]
[00:31.14]Gather around
[00:35.05]As we're pushed towards the fire
[00:41.28]We've been tricked into believing that all
[00:47.14]Starts and ends within our walls
[00:51.93]
[01:20.41]Gather around
[01:24.27]Holding close your sons and daughters
[01:30.42]Promise them that we will all be alright
[01:36.52]Let them know you love them all
[01:40.99]
[01:45.04]Talk to yourself
[01:48.86]Let your essence be the answer
[01:54.97]While we chase the meaning of who we are
[02:01.29]Navigating through a storm
[02:05.70]
[02:09.68]Gather around and follow me
[02:15.62]Something misled us to this
[02:21.92]Wanting it all is poverty
[02:28.18]Rich is the one who is free
[02:35.09]Be the one who wakes up
[02:40.40]All of those who roam
[02:48.57]
[03:39.40]Shake your head to the sides
[03:42.66]Wake the animal inside of you
[03:48.59]
[03:51.93]Run away from it all
[03:54.96]Let the wildness be your home
[04:00.01]
[04:04.12]Plant a tree, kill a man
[04:07.35]Let your instincts be in charge of you
[04:13.13]
[04:16.55]Where you walk, what you dream
[04:19.58]Measures who you really are
[04:24.66]
[04:52.68]Turn to your friends
[04:56.56]Let them face the one you mirror
[05:02.87]And the demons that now rest on your side
[05:08.86]They will leave you on your own
[05:11.82]